              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The Three Cases",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Case",
                "f(n)",
                "Result",
                "Example"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "polynomially smaller",
                  "Θ(n^(log_b a))",
                  "leaves dominate"
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "= Θ(n^(log_b a))",
                  "Θ(n^(log_b a) · log n)",
                  "merge sort: Θ(n log n)"
                ],
                [
                  "3",
                  "polynomially larger + regularity",
                  "Θ(f(n))",
                  "T=2T(n/2)+n²: Θ(n²)"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Binary search `T(n/2)+1`: n^0 = 1 = f(n), so ==Case 2==, Θ(log n)",
                "Case 3 also needs the **regularity condition** on f(n)"
